The V3 mask textures (*_MASK_BARE.dds, built by v3/scripts/bake_masks.py) and the crew nose hulls (STMS_B3_Hull*.mu, built by
v3/scripts/derive_nose.py) and the expendable core's windward stringers (STMS_B3_Stringers.mu, built by v3/scripts/derive_stringers.py) are derived from Starship Expansion Project art. They and the SEP models shown by the engine rings are All Rights Reserved by their
authors and are not covered by the licences above.

The Avionics cockpit places ASET Props and ASET Avionics props (by alexustas, adopted by Stone Blue; CC BY-NC-SA 3.0) by name; none of
their files are included. How each prop sits on a panel (its/data/aset_mounts.json) is derived from the ALCOR cockpit by alexustas, maintained
by JonnyOThan (CC BY-NC-SA 3.0), and is shared under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 with that credit.
